    "Pinned service plus fresh purpose-separated registrar signature; never a staff wrapper or GET.",
    "Authenticate original immutable job/requester/current authority/epoch/expiry/revision and retained artifact hash before and after private read; current-access propagation veto is mandatory before activation.",
    "Only completed immutable encrypted capture may be recovered. Verify canonical artifact hash, exact closed artifact/schema/UTF8 bytes, full source/recipe/snapshot/parity bindings against original job and admitted recipe.",
